		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-b0999bb e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="b0999bb" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}">
					<div class="e-con-inner">
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-034fac7 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="034fac7" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e44509f elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="e44509f" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInUp&quot;,&quot;_animation_delay&quot;:0}" data-widget_type="heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Our Products</h2>				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-9246662 elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="9246662" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInUp&quot;,&quot;_animation_delay&quot;:0}" data-widget_type="heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<h4 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">AI-native and Safety-capable Platforms for Event-Driven Physical&nbsp;AI</h4>				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-1447ca7 elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="1447ca7" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInUp&quot;,&quot;_animation_delay&quot;:0}" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p>Building Open Compute for Physical AI. For decades, software adapted to hardware. Physical AI reverses that model. MIPS enables a new approach to computing where workloads drive architecture, software informs silicon, and open platforms accelerate innovation. Our innovations are designed to accelerate the development and deployment of Physical AI systems at scale.</p>								</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-143deee e-grid e-con-full e-con e-child" data-id="143deee" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-719bf95 e-con-full product-card animated-fast e-flex elementor-invisible e-con e-child" data-id="719bf95" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;,&quot;animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInUp&quot;,&quot;animation_delay&quot;:250}">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-c139b07 elementor-view-stacked product-icon elementor-shape-circle elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon" data-id="c139b07" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="icon.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
